ortedConfigs":{"browseEndpointContextMusicConfig":{"pageType":"MUSIC_PAGE_TYPE_NON_MUSIC_AUDIO_TRACK_PAGE"}}}}}]},"secondTitle":{"runs":[{"text":"The Bulwark Daily with Tim Miller","navigationEndpoint":{"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"MPSPPLJNKzTkCZE9vDHDa6ejyyEO1p4_e1RMt6","browseEndpointContextSupportedConfigs":{"browseEndpointContextMusicConfig":{"pageType":"MUSIC_PAGE_TYPE_PODCAST_SHOW_DETAIL_PAGE"}}}}}]},"description":{"runs":[{"text":"The president of the United States, who has millions invested in Nvidia, got the company’s board to reinstate spy-shagging Jensen Huang as CEO—despite the serious legal questions around China getting access to our advanced chips. Trump showed yet again that he’ll put his money, as well as the wealth of our plutocratic oligarchs, before the national security interests of the country. Plus: The Chinese and the Russians are celebrating the gullibility of POTUS, Kim Jong Un is ghosting Trump, Dems will have their largest majority in the House since 1992—but they also need to stand up to the DNC—and word is spreading that MAGA is dead. Bill Kristol joins Tim Miller.\n\nAdditional $5 off at https://auraframes.com/pdp/THEBULWARK. Promo Code\n\nShow notes:\n\nBill and Andrew in Monday's \"Morning Shots\":\nhttps://www.thebulwark.com/p/should-we-feel-sorry-for-old-man-trump-putin-xi-china-russia-nvidia-huang-grand-theft-auto-vi\n\nJVL's \"Triad\":\nhttps://www.thebulwark.com/s/thetriad\n\nBill with Bob Kagan for \"Bulwark on Sunday\":\nhttps://www.thebulwark.com/p/putin-got-everything-he-wanted-from\n\nTim's Friday interview with Anne Applebaum:\nhttps://podcasts.apple.com/us/podcast/anne-applebaum-all-the-corruption-all-the-time/id1447684472?i=1000803192365\n\nTim's Thursday interview with Patrick Gaspard:\nhttps://youtu.be/hFeBIm6HYTQ?si=Y2TWAyDDpLa5jCvV\n\nTim and JVL on the Trump presser:\nhttps://www.youtube.com/live/C8mwoi_Wb5c?si=KyyQCz4dsBZs0EUF\n\nFollow “Reporter and the Spy” on Apple Podcasts, on Spotify, on YouTube, or\nwherever